  guideTitle: "Washable Rugs: Pros, Cons and When They Beat a Pad Plus Wool",
  metaTitle: "Washable Rugs: Pros and Cons",
  metaDescription: "Machine capacity against rug size, thin pile, backing wear and drying time decide whether a washable rug works, and when wool with a pad is the better call.",
